Randomix — Linux port
=====================

This Linux port is a Flutter rewrite of the Android app Randomix
(https://github.com/m-i-n-a-r/randomix), released under the MIT license.

Original work:
    Copyright (c) 2020 minar
    https://github.com/m-i-n-a-r/randomix

Reused from upstream, unmodified:
    app/src/main/res/raw/roulette_sound.mp3
    app/src/main/res/raw/coin_sound.wav
    app/src/main/res/raw/magicball_sound.mp3
    app/src/main/res/raw/dice_sound.wav
    app/src/main/res/drawable-nodpi/intro_icon.png
    app/src/main/res/drawable-nodpi/banner_minar.png
    fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/images/icon.png
    app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml (English strings, transcribed into lib/strings.dart)

The MIT license text is available in LICENSE.upstream.md at the repository root.
